{
  "slug": "catalyst-by-zoho",
  "name": "Catalyst By Zoho",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Official Claude Code plugin for Catalyst by Zoho — full-stack serverless cloud platform. With Skills that covers all services, SDKs, CLI, architecture patterns, pricing, migration guides, and Zoho MCP tool-based resource management.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills**, **1 command**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `catalyst-appsail` (Catalyst AppSail — persistent backend PaaS with managed runtimes (Node.js, Java, Python) and custom Docker containers), `catalyst-authentication` (Catalyst Authentication — user login/signup, ZAID, Web SDK auth flows, and OAuth token management via Connections), `catalyst-basics` (Core Catalyst project setup — directory structure, environments, CLI commands, and all Catalyst IDs (Project ID, ZAID, Table…), `catalyst-by-zoho` (Expert coding assistant for Catalyst by Zoho — Zoho's full-stack serverless cloud platform), `catalyst-cache` (Catalyst Cache — in-memory key-value store with TTL for ephemeral session and temporary data), `catalyst-datastore` (Catalyst Data Store — relational cloud database with ZCQL, CRUD operations, table permissions, and result pagination), `catalyst-functions` (Catalyst serverless functions — all 7 types (Basic I/O, Advanced I/O, Event, Cron, Job, Integration, Browser Logic), handler…), `catalyst-nosql` (Catalyst NoSQL — key-value table store with typed items built via NoSQLItem builder), and 8 more\n- **Commands** (1): `switch-dc` (Switch the Catalyst by Zoho MCP server to a specified data center)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `catalyst-by-zoho`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install catalyst-by-zoho@claude-plugins-official` from `catalystbyzoho/claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
